  "articleBody": "A successful shower tile project depends less on the tile itself than on a continuous waterproof assembly, a properly sloped shower base, compatible setting materials, and careful detailing at corners, penetrations, niches, and the drain. Before hiring, confirm the contractor will explain the system, scope, inspections, finish selections, and responsibility for correcting hidden damage.",
